########################################
# RULES

# Trailing / matches DIRECTORY ONLY
# Leading / matches only at the .gitignore file level

# 1. /build/
#     - Matches DIRECTORY ONLY named build
#     - Matches ONLY at .gitignore file level
#     - Does not MATCH a regular FILE named build

# 2. /build
#     - Matches BOTH FILES AND DIRECTORIES named build
#     - Matches ONLY at any the .gitignore file level

# 3. build/
#     - Matches DIRECTORY ONLY named build
#     - Matches at any depth below the .gitignore file:
#           - build/
#           - app/build/
#           - src/module/build/
#     - Does not MATCH a regular FILE named build

# 4. build or **/build
#     - Matches BOTH FILES AND DIRECTORIES named build
#     - Matches at any depth below the .gitignore file:
#           - build (file)
#           - app/build (file named build under app named directory)
#           - src/module/build (file named build under src/module)
#           - build/
#           - app/build/
#           - src/module/build/

# 5. *.log
#     - Matches all .log files
#     - Matches at any depth below the .gitignore file:
########################################

